    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Randall is a stylish contemporary four-bedroom residence set on approx. 0.2 acres of landscaped grounds in the much sought-after Well Road in Douglas. Douglas Village with all amenities is just a short walk away and Pairc Úi Chaoimh is approximately a 30 minute walk. \r\n\r\nRandall was purchased by the vendors in 2024 following a complete refurbishment of the original 1980’s house.  The  extensive renovations of the property included a new roof, an impressive sunroom extension, up-graded to a BER B1 rating and finished to the highest standard inside and out. \r\n\r\nEntering into the  hallway with a large picture window, one immediately recognises this is  a house to entertain in.  The hall has two large double pocket sliding doors which link on the left to a beautiful lounge with an inset multi-fuel stove and large window that frames the garden. On the right it opens to a large open-plan kitchen that incorporates a dining space and sunroom with its panoramic floor to ceiling windows and large sliding door to the terrace and garden. The kitchen has high-end units with quartz island and backsplash and appliances. The seamless kitchen leads to the utility room that offers lots more storage and AEG washing and drying machines and another sink.\r\n\r\nTo the rear of the hall is a family room and a ground floor bedroom with access to a wet room. \r\nThis house is all about flow and the ground floor is finished in an engineered oak timber floor from room to room.\r\n\r\nOn the first floor are three double bedrooms and family bathroom.  The master bedroom has its own bathroom and walk-in wardrobe.  The attic above is also carpeted and offers much more storage space.\r\n\r\nExternally the finish is excellent with private parking inside the electronic gates.  The gravel driveway has limestone kerbing which links to the large limestone paving terrace at the back of the house.  Areas of lawn with shrub and tree planting create a perfect back drop for summer entertaining. The manageable .2 of an acre grounds are landscaped and ready for the next owner to maintain with minimal effort.\r\n\r\nRandall is in impeccable condition inside and out, all the next owner will need do is unpack their bags. \r\n\r\nServices: Mains services, Gas Heating, EV Charging Point."
      },
